    "---\n",
    "## Phase 2: Transparent NLP Preprocessing Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "A standard failure in automated text clustering and summarization is indiscriminate text scrubbing, where crucial domain terms (e.g., numbers, hyphenated compounds like *two-qubit*, *fault-tolerant*, *RSA-2048*) are stripped away. Furthermore, applying extractive summarization to aggressively lemmatized text produces unreadable, ungrammatical fragments.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Dual-Stream Preprocessing Strategy\n",
    "QuantumLens implements a transparent **Dual-Stream Pipeline**:\n",
    "1. **Original Raw Stream (`text_raw`)**: Preserved with exact capitalization, punctuation, and sentence syntax for **Extractive TextRank Summarization**.\n",
    "2. **Normalized Feature Stream (`text_clean` / `tokens_clean`)**: Undergoes structured normalization, entity-safe tokenization, domain-preserving stopword pruning, and morphological lemmatization for **TF-IDF Vector Space Modeling**.\n",
    "\n",
    "| Operation | Method / Regex | Academic Justification |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| **HTML / Entity Stripping** | `re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', text)` | Removes web markup and DOM fragments from scraped news feeds. |\n",
    "| **Unicode & Whitespace Normalization** | `re.sub(r'\\s+', ' ', text).strip()` | Resolves non-breaking spaces, carriage returns, and encoding artifacts. |\n",
    "| **Hyphen-Aware Tokenization** | `\\b[a-zA-Z0-9]+(?:-[a-zA-Z0-9]+)*\\b` | Retains compound technical adjectives (e.g. *error-correction*, *trapped-ion*). |\n",
    "| **Domain Stopword Pruning** | `w not in STOPWORDS_SET` | Eliminates syntactically frequent, semantically empty functional words. |\n",
    "| **Morphological Lemmatization** | `LEMMATIZER.lemmatize(w)` | Reduces inflectional forms (e.g. *qubits* $\\rightarrow$ *qubit*, *simulations* $\\rightarrow$ *simulation*) without losing root meaning. |"
   ]
  },
