    "---\n",
    "## Phase 6: Explain Why Each Document Belongs to a Cluster\n",
    "\n",
    "### The 9-Factor Evidence-Based Attribution Framework\n",
    "The primary innovation of QuantumLens is that **no document assignment is a black box**. Every assignment is substantiated by calculated numerical and topological facts:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Document-Specific Features**: Top TF-IDF keywords characterizing document $d_i$.\n",
    "2. **Cluster Centroid Features**: Dominant TF-IDF terms characterizing the assigned cluster's centroid vector $\\mathbf{c}_C$.\n",
    "3. **Shared Vocabulary Overlap**: Exact intersection $\\mathcal{K}_{\\text{doc}} \\cap \\mathcal{K}_{\\text{cluster}}$ with individual feature weights.\n",
    "4. **Nearest Neighbor Relationships**: Top-$k$ nearest documents with exact cosine distances and cosine similarities.\n",
    "5. **Edge Acceptance Status**: Explicit check whether each neighbor link satisfies the similarity threshold $\\tau = 0.25$.\n",
    "6. **Topological Graph Connectivity**: Tracing whether the document is connected via a direct 1-hop edge or an **indirect multi-hop path (exposing chaining)**.\n",
    "7. **Nearest Alternative Cluster**: Identification of the closest competing cluster $C_{\\text{alt}} = \\arg\\max_{C_j \\neq C} \\cos(\\mathbf{x}_i, \\mathbf{c}_{C_j})$.\n",
    "8. **Separation Margin ($\Delta$)**: The margin $\\Delta = \\cos(\\mathbf{x}_i, \\mathbf{c}_C) - \\cos(\\mathbf{x}_i, \\mathbf{c}_{C_{\\text{alt}}})$. If $\\Delta < 0.08$, the document is explicitly flagged as **Ambiguous**.\n",
    "9. **Honest Isolation Handling**: If all neighbor similarities fall below $\\tau$, the document is transparently classified as an **Isolated Outlier**."
   ]
