    "---\n",
    "## Phase 7: Cluster-Level Synthesis & Multi-Document Summarization\n",
    "\n",
    "### Multi-Document Synthesis Methodology\n",
    "Rather than concatenating entire articles (which creates unmanageable redundancy), QuantumLens constructs **Cluster-Level Summaries** hierarchically:\n",
    "1. **Graph Medoid / Exemplar Extraction**: For each discovered cluster, we compute the within-cluster degree and eigenvector centrality. The document with the highest centrality represents the **Thematic Medoid**.\n",
    "2. **Dominant Keyword Aggregation**: We extract terms that appear across multiple member documents with the highest aggregated TF-IDF weight.\n",
    "3. **Synthesis of Common Themes**: The concise TextRank summaries of the medoid and key neighbor documents are synthesized into a coherent thematic summary.\n",
    "4. **Subtopic Divergence & Intra-Cluster Variance**: Documents within the same cluster often address distinct sub-technologies (e.g. within Quantum Hardware, trapped ions vs neutral atoms vs superconducting transmons). QuantumLens explicitly identifies and highlights these distinct subtopics."
   ]
