    "        'source': 'Renewable Energy Letters'\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'doc_id': 'USR_02',\n",
    "        'title': 'Silicon-Perovskite Tandem Solar Modules Pass Rigorous Weathering Tests',\n",
    "        'text': 'Next-generation tandem solar panels combining silicon and perovskite semiconductors have demonstrated 25 years of simulated operational stability under thermal damp heat tests. The protective polymer encapsulation prevents moisture ingress and degradation of the halide crystalline lattice. Commercial solar developers project that these tandem cells will replace traditional silicon photovoltaics within five years.',\n",
    "        'source': 'CleanTech Review'\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'doc_id': 'USR_03',\n",
    "        'title': 'CRISPR Cas9 Gene Editing Corrects Monogenic Retinal Dystrophy in Human Clinical Trials',\n",
    "        'text': 'A Phase II clinical trial confirmed that in vivo CRISPR Cas9 gene editing successfully restored vision in patients suffering from congenital blindness. The molecular therapy utilizes lipid nanoparticle delivery to target defective CEP290 splice mutations directly in photoreceptor cells. Biopharmaceutical regulators noted that no off-target cleavage events were detected across long-term genomic sequencing.',\n",
    "        'source': 'Biomedical Innovation Journal'\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "analyze_custom_user_corpus(demo_custom_articles, k=2, tau=0.18)"
