    "---\n",
    "## Phase 12: Academic Discussion, Limitations & Future Work\n",
    "\n",
    "### Algorithmic Strengths of the QuantumLens Framework\n",
    "1. **Transparent Explainability**: Unlike black-box vector databases or opaque neural embeddings, QuantumLens generates explanations rooted in mathematical facts (feature overlap, cosine metrics, graph edges, and alternative margins).\n",
    "2. **Natural Outlier Detection**: The KNN-based thresholded graph algorithm naturally separates isolated documents (degree 0) rather than forcing them into artificial clusters.\n",
    "3. **Zero Generative Hallucination**: Extractive TextRank with chronological reordering preserves exact author discourse, numbers, and technical terminology.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Documented Limitations\n",
    "1. **The Chaining Phenomenon in Connected Components**: As discussed in Section 5, connected components rely on transitive paths. In noisy datasets with bridge documents, two disparate topics may be merged if intermediate documents span both vocabularies. Future enhancements could incorporate community detection algorithms (e.g. Louvain or Leiden modularity maximization) to partition chained components.\n",
    "2. **Sensitivity to Threshold $\\tau$**: The number of discovered clusters is sensitive to the choice of $\\tau$. While our sensitivity grid search provides empirical guidance, optimal $\\tau$ selection remains dependent on corpus density.\n",
    "3. **Vocabulary Mismatch in TF-IDF**: Pure TF-IDF relies on exact lexical unigram and bigram overlap. Synonyms (e.g. *attenuation* vs *loss*) are not captured without dense contextual embeddings or semantic thesauri.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Conclusion & Deliverable Checklist\n",
    "- [x] **Multi-Modal Document Input**: Supports CSV, direct dictionary lists, and `.txt` files with strict schema validation.\n",
    "- [x] **Transparent Preprocessing**: Preserves original text for summarization while cleaning text for feature modeling.\n",
    "- [x] **Text Representation**: Robust TF-IDF with unigrams, bigrams, sublinear scaling, and top-term diagnostics.\n",
    "- [x] **Extractive Summarization**: Graph-based TextRank with PageRank centrality, chronological ordering, and compression metrics.\n",
    "- [x] **KNN-Based Graph Clustering**: Exact scikit-learn NearestNeighbors with cosine distance, graph thresholding, connected components, and isolated outlier detection.\n",
    "- [x] **Explainability Engine**: 9-factor attribution with shared keywords, neighbor links, graph paths, alternative margins, and natural language explanations.\n",
    "- [x] **Cluster-Level Synthesis**: Graph medoids, shared themes, and intra-cluster subtopic divergence.\n",
    "- [x] **Visual Analytics**: Similarity matrix heatmap, spring graph layout, 2D PCA projection, and cluster size distribution.\n",
    "- [x] **Evaluation & Unit Tests**: Intra/inter similarity, sensitivity grid search, and explainability verification tests.\n",
    "- [x] **Multi-Format Export**: Automated CSV and JSON result exports."
